{"vid":"fBxDwJHeHcE","source":"fBxDwJHeHcE.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"What are employers actually looking for"},{"t":2.2,"txt":"in an administrative assistant? Well,"},{"t":4.4,"txt":"there are a few essential skills and"},{"t":6.4,"txt":"today I'm joined by Indeed career"},{"t":8.2,"txt":"strategist Mary Ann to share her"},{"t":9.8,"txt":"insights."},{"t":10.9,"txt":">> When employers talk about top"},{"t":12.5,"txt":"candidates, they're not just looking for"},{"t":14.3,"txt":"technical skills. They're looking for"},{"t":16.2,"txt":"people who can operate in complexity."},{"t":18.3,"txt":"[music]"},{"t":18.9,"txt":"Multitasking and handling different"},{"t":21,"txt":"personalities are core skills employers"},{"t":23,"txt":"will be looking for."},{"t":24.2,"txt":">> [music]"},{"t":24.4,"txt":">> One essential role of an admin assistant"},{"t":26.5,"txt":"is to communicate professionally and"},{"t":28.4,"txt":"effectively [music] both inside and"},{"t":30.4,"txt":"outside the company. This can mean being"},{"t":32.8,"txt":"a liaison between departments or"},{"t":34.9,"txt":"answering and routing phone calls. This"},{"t":36.6,"txt":"might seem obvious, but [music] admin"},{"t":38.5,"txt":"assistants perform a range of tasks from"},{"t":41.2,"txt":"ordering supplies to planning company"},{"t":43.2,"txt":"events,"},{"t":43.9,"txt":">> [music]"},{"t":44.1,"txt":">> meetings and conferences. Additional"},{"t":46.3,"txt":"responsibilities like data entry,"},{"t":48.5,"txt":">> [music]"},{"t":48.6,"txt":">> expense reports and record keeping may"},{"t":50.6,"txt":"also come into play. Admin assistants"},{"t":52.6,"txt":"need to have excellent interpersonal and"},{"t":54.3,"txt":"collaboration skills in order to build"},{"t":56.2,"txt":"trusted relationships with clients,"},{"t":58.2,"txt":"customers and colleagues. They use"},{"t":60.2,"txt":"computers and smartphones for most"},{"t":61.9,"txt":"communication and documentation. So some"},{"t":64.4,"txt":"tech savvy is a must. Admin [music]"},{"t":66.2,"txt":"assistants manage several calendars for"},{"t":68.2,"txt":"executives and managers, sometimes a"},{"t":70.5,"txt":"whole office,"},{"t":71.4,"txt":">> [music]"},{"t":71.4,"txt":">> not to mention their own. Strong"},{"t":73.1,"txt":"organizational skills are the backbone"},{"t":75.3,"txt":"of their work, ensuring smooth"},{"t":77.3,"txt":"scheduling across the org. Feeling"},{"t":79.4,"txt":"confident in your skills now? Great."},{"t":81.7,"txt":"Then let's talk about interview"},{"t":82.8,"txt":"questions. Question number one, how do"},{"t":85.6,"txt":"you prioritize tasks? This question"},{"t":87.8,"txt":"examines your ability to juggle several"},{"t":89.7,"txt":"competing responsibilities successfully."},{"t":91.7,"txt":"[music] In answering this question, you"},{"t":93.9,"txt":"want to highlight your skills such as"},{"t":95.4,"txt":"organization, multitasking and time"},{"t":98,"txt":"management. To elaborate more, I'm going"},{"t":100.6,"txt":"to turn it over to Mary Ann."},{"t":102.5,"txt":">> Multitasking isn't about doing"},{"t":104.3,"txt":"everything at once. It's about"},{"t":106.8,"txt":"prioritizing when everything feels"},{"t":108.7,"txt":"urgent. [music] So in interviews, don't"},{"t":110.9,"txt":"say, \"I multitask well.\" Share a quick"},{"t":113.8,"txt":"story about competing priorities, how"},{"t":116,"txt":"you chose what mattered and what"},{"t":117.8,"txt":"happened as the result."},{"t":119.3,"txt":">> Here's an example of what that could"},{"t":120.8,"txt":"sound like. In my experience as an"},{"t":123,"txt":"administrative assistant, prioritizing"},{"t":125.3,"txt":"tasks starts with understanding urgency"},{"t":127.7,"txt":"and impact. I begin each day by"},{"t":130,"txt":"reviewing my to-do list and organizing"},{"t":132.4,"txt":"items by deadlines, [music]"},{"t":133.8,"txt":"business priorities, and what will most"},{"t":136,"txt":"directly support the team's goals. For"},{"t":138.4,"txt":"example, [music] if I receive an urgent"},{"t":140.4,"txt":"request from a manager while I'm working"},{"t":142.2,"txt":"on routine scheduling, I'll assess if"},{"t":144.4,"txt":"the new task has an immediate deadline"},{"t":146.6,"txt":"or [music] impacts key stakeholders."},{"t":148.6,"txt":"I'll start by clarifying time"},{"t":150.3,"txt":"expectations, then adjust [music] my"},{"t":152.2,"txt":"schedule accordingly. And I always"},{"t":154.4,"txt":"communicate clearly if shifting"},{"t":156,"txt":"priorities will affect a timeline."},{"t":158.4,"txt":"Remember, your answer should show off"},{"t":160.3,"txt":"your ability to juggle multiple tasks"},{"t":162.3,"txt":"and your organizational skills, [music]"},{"t":164.2,"txt":"all while keeping your cool when things"},{"t":165.9,"txt":"get busy and being flexible when the"},{"t":167.9,"txt":"occasion arises. Question number two,"},{"t":170.4,"txt":"describe a situation where you had a"},{"t":172.1,"txt":"conflict with a colleague and how you"},{"t":173.8,"txt":"resolved it. Interviewers ask this"},{"t":175.8,"txt":"question to see how you navigate"},{"t":177.4,"txt":"disagreements, [music] whether you can"},{"t":179,"txt":"stay professional when tensions arise,"},{"t":181.4,"txt":"and how effectively you problem-solve"},{"t":183.3,"txt":"when personalities clash. Here's an"},{"t":185,"txt":"example you can reference to practice. I"},{"t":187.4,"txt":"once worked with a colleague who had a"},{"t":188.9,"txt":"more formal communication style for"},{"t":190.7,"txt":"mine, which led to missed details on"},{"t":192.8,"txt":"shared tasks. I addressed it by having a"},{"t":195.2,"txt":"brief, respectful conversation to"},{"t":197.2,"txt":"clarify expectations. [music] We agreed"},{"t":199.3,"txt":"on a simple framework. Every request"},{"t":201.8,"txt":"would include what's needed, the"},{"t":203.2,"txt":"deadline, and any relevant context."},{"t":205.9,"txt":"After that, deadlines were met more"},{"t":207.6,"txt":"consistently and the working"},{"t":209.2,"txt":"relationship became much smoother. You"},{"t":211.5,"txt":"want to show your interviewer you're the"},{"t":212.9,"txt":"person to count on when tensions are"},{"t":214.4,"txt":"high. Question number three, what's the"},{"t":216.8,"txt":"most successful [music] project you've"},{"t":218,"txt":"worked on as an administrative"},{"t":219.4,"txt":"assistant, and why do you think it was"},{"t":221,"txt":"successful? This is your time to shine."},{"t":223.7,"txt":"Share a win that demonstrates you"},{"t":225.4,"txt":"understand their priorities and can"},{"t":227.2,"txt":"deliver measurable impact, not just"},{"t":229.3,"txt":"complete tasks. [music]"},{"t":230.5,"txt":"You're not just sharing your success"},{"t":232.3,"txt":"story. You're showing that you're the"},{"t":234.6,"txt":"assistant for the job. That means"},{"t":236.6,"txt":"structuring your answer to touch on"},{"t":238,"txt":"their needs as an organization."},{"t":240,"txt":">> A great story shows impact, [music] not"},{"t":243.1,"txt":"effort. Talk about how you improved a"},{"t":245.6,"txt":"process, prevented a problem, or helped"},{"t":248.4,"txt":"a leader succeed. And what changed"},{"t":250.8,"txt":"because of you?"},{"t":252.2,"txt":">> Now you're ready to answer questions."},{"t":254.3,"txt":"Are you ready to ask them? The questions"},{"t":256.6,"txt":"you ask in an interview are important"},{"t":258.6,"txt":"because they show that you're engaged"},{"t":260.1,"txt":"and actively thinking about the demands"},{"t":261.8,"txt":"of the role and the organization's"},{"t":263.5,"txt":"needs. They can also help you learn if"},{"t":266.2,"txt":"the role and organization are the right"},{"t":267.8,"txt":"fit for you."},{"t":269.2,"txt":">> Best questions to ask as a candidate"},{"t":271.2,"txt":"[music] are, \"What does success look"},{"t":273,"txt":"like in the first 90 days? How does this"},{"t":275.2,"txt":"role partner with leadership? Which"},{"t":277.1,"txt":"[music] tools or systems will I be"},{"t":278.7,"txt":"working with every day?\""},{"t":280.4,"txt":">> Here are a few questions you can ask to"},{"t":282.4,"txt":"help you stand [music] out. \"How does"},{"t":284.1,"txt":"your team prefer to communicate"},{"t":285.5,"txt":"throughout the day?\" This tells them"},{"t":287.4,"txt":"you're ready to hit the ground running."},{"t":289.3,"txt":"You're not just asking about tools,"},{"t":291.4,"txt":"you're figuring out [music] how to be"},{"t":292.6,"txt":"accessible, responsive, and effective in"},{"t":295.4,"txt":"the way that works best for the specific"},{"t":297.1,"txt":"team culture. [music]"},{"t":298,"txt":"\"What calendar management style does the"},{"t":300.2,"txt":"office prefer?\" This question"},{"t":302,"txt":"demonstrates you're thinking about the"},{"t":303.5,"txt":"day-to-day responsibilities. This may"},{"t":306.1,"txt":"also be an opportunity to talk relevant"},{"t":308.2,"txt":"skills [music] and software knowledge,"},{"t":310,"txt":"like project management tools or CRMs."},{"t":313,"txt":"If they're looking [music] for an Asana"},{"t":314.7,"txt":"maven and you live and breathe Asana,"},{"t":317.7,"txt":"that's a match made [music] in heaven."},{"t":319.2,"txt":"\"How do people in this role typically"},{"t":320.8,"txt":"grow within the company?\" This question"},{"t":322.7,"txt":"signals to your interviewer that you're"},{"t":324.2,"txt":"thinking long-term and that you're"},{"t":325.9,"txt":"looking for an organization you can"},{"t":327.5,"txt":"invest in. Before wrapping up the"},{"t":329.2,"txt":"interview, don't [music] forget to"},{"t":330.6,"txt":"prepare a forward-looking closing remark"},{"t":333.4,"txt":"that highlights the impact that you'd"},{"t":335.6,"txt":"like to make in the role."},{"t":336.7,"txt":">> [music]"},{"t":336.7,"txt":">> We get it. Job interviews can be"},{"t":338.7,"txt":"stressful, but one way to calm your"},{"t":340.9,"txt":"nerves is to be prepared. Here are three"},{"t":343.2,"txt":"simple steps you can take to make sure"},{"t":345.2,"txt":"you're more than ready. So, study the"},{"t":347,"txt":"job description, research the company,"},{"t":349.6,"txt":"and of course practice your answers. It"},{"t":352.2,"txt":"might seem daunting at first, but when"},{"t":354,"txt":"you get that offer letter, you'll be"},{"t":355.4,"txt":"grateful you did. Your skills are"},{"t":357.7,"txt":"essential to making an office run"},{"t":359.4,"txt":"smoothly, so be confident in them, and"},{"t":362,"txt":"show your interviewer that they couldn't"},{"t":363.6,"txt":"function without you, because they kind"},{"t":365.2,"txt":"of can't. Good luck, and go crush that"},{"t":368.1,"txt":"interview. For more career advice,"},{"t":370.3,"txt":"search Indeed on YouTube, or visit our"},{"t":372.8,"txt":"website."}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"What"},{"t":0.2,"w":"are"},{"t":0.32,"w":"employers"},{"t":1.08,"w":"actually"},{"t":1.56,"w":"looking"},{"t":1.92,"w":"for"},{"t":2.24,"w":"in"},{"t":2.36,"w":"an"},{"t":2.48,"w":"administrative"},{"t":3.08,"w":"assistant?"},{"t":3.84,"w":"Well,"},{"t":4.36,"w":"there"},{"t":4.56,"w":"are"},{"t":4.64,"w":"a"},{"t":4.68,"w":"few"},{"t":4.96,"w":"essential"},{"t":5.36,"w":"skills"},{"t":6.24,"w":"and"},{"t":6.4,"w":"today"},{"t":6.92,"w":"I'm"},{"t":7.08,"w":"joined"},{"t":7.32,"w":"by"},{"t":7.48,"w":"Indeed"},{"t":7.88,"w":"career"},{"t":8.2,"w":"strategist"},{"t":8.8,"w":"Mary"},{"t":9.12,"w":"Ann"},{"t":9.4,"w":"to"},{"t":9.52,"w":"share"},{"t":9.72,"w":"her"},{"t":9.84,"w":"insights."},{"t":10.88,"w":">>"},{"t":10.88,"w":"When"},{"t":11,"w":"employers"},{"t":11.6,"w":"talk"},{"t":11.88,"w":"about"},{"t":12.2,"w":"top"},{"t":12.52,"w":"candidates,"},{"t":13.24,"w":"they're"},{"t":13.4,"w":"not"},{"t":13.56,"w":"just"},{"t":13.8,"w":"looking"},{"t":14.12,"w":"for"},{"t":14.28,"w":"technical"},{"t":14.8,"w":"skills."},{"t":15.6,"w":"They're"},{"t":15.76,"w":"looking"},{"t":16.04,"w":"for"},{"t":16.2,"w":"people"},{"t":16